    '<div class=muted style="margin-top:8px;font-size:11px">file activity from persisted Edit/Write calls (Claude transcripts, OpenCode SQLite parts, Kimi wire logs, or Grok session JSONL); line counts are payload-based approximations — orchestrator-run DIFF remains the exact git view</div>';
